    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_content">floatTime\n\nA simple, minimal floating countdown app for Android.\n\n• Circular floating icon, draggable anywhere on the screen\n• Long-press to set up: task name + duration in minutes\n• While counting, the icon shows the task name above and a seconds-level countdown below\n• Phone vibrates when time is up\n• Customizable idle/active colors and ball diameter\n\nColors: Peach RGB(251,204,199) / Mint RGB(149,197,172)\nLiquid glass dynamic UI</string>
